# Docs

Every MCP server package has a `README.md`. The root [`README.md`](README.md) lists servers in a table that links to that file. Adding, renaming, or removing a server updates the table in the same change.

```markdown
<!-- ❌ BAD — server exists with no docs and no table row -->

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
| Server | Description | Docs |
| --- | --- | --- |
| obs | OBS Studio MCP server | [obs/README.md](obs/README.md) |
```
